        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: Coco\n- People: Alan Jay Lerner, André Previn, Coco Chanel, Ann Reinking\n- Topics: Broadway musicals, musical theater\n\nFacts:\n- In 1969, \"Coco\" was a Broadway musical inspired by the life of Coco Chanel.\n- \"Coco\" had a book and lyrics by Alan Jay Lerner and music by André Previn.\n- André Previn, born Andreas Ludwig Priwin on April 6, 1929, was a German-American pianist, conductor, and composer.\n- Ann Reinking's musical theater work included starring in the 1969 Broadway production of \"Coco\".",
